{"unit_id":"xiaoso456__dsh-turn-navigator#card-zh","repo":"xiaoso456/dsh-turn-navigator","commit":"89e87a25b960c549be4019e63191697d01fed7ea","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@xiaoso/dsh-turn-navigator 是面向 DSH Web 对话界面的轮次导航插件。它将固定侧边面板注册到 shell.overlay，并从当前会话快照和 sessionStats 投影计算轮次状态；用户可查看当前轮数与总轮数，使用上下按钮跳到相邻轮次，或点击轮次标签输入数字直接跳转。跳转时会按需载入较早的会话历史，并滚动到目标轮次；面板还跟踪视口中的当前轮次，并避让详情栏。适合需要在长对话中快速定位或浏览历史轮次的 DSH Web 用户。安装为 DSH Web 插件即可，不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:1-11","src/client/index.ts:80-86","src/client/index.ts:202-270","src/client/TurnNavigatorPanel.tsx:182-271"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaoso456__dsh-turn-navigator#card-en","repo":"xiaoso456/dsh-turn-navigator","commit":"89e87a25b960c549be4019e63191697d01fed7ea","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@xiaoso/dsh-turn-navigator adds turn navigation to DSH Web chat. Its overlay shows current and total turns, with buttons for adjacent turns and number entry for direct jumps. It loads older history as needed. Useful for browsing long chats; no key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:80-86","src/client/index.ts:202-270","src/client/TurnNavigatorPanel.tsx:182-271"]}
