{"unit_id":"xiaoso456__dsh-turn-navigator#feature-1","repo":"xiaoso456/dsh-turn-navigator","commit":"89e87a25b960c549be4019e63191697d01fed7ea","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@xiaoso/dsh-turn-navigator 的功能「当前轮次与总数」：侧边面板显示视口所在轮次和会话总轮数，并随滚动位置更新当前轮次。点击轮次标签可切换为数字输入。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/TurnNavigatorPanel.tsx:133-165","src/client/TurnNavigatorPanel.tsx:187-205"]}
